{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.hrefl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">hrefl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Close given goal using `HEq.refl`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.hrefl","kind":"def","line":73,"name":"Lean.MVarId.hrefl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.lean#L73-L79"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.eqOfHEq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">eqOfHEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Try to apply `eq_of_heq`. If successful, then return new goal, otherwise return `mvarId`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.eqOfHEq","kind":"def","line":65,"name":"Lean.MVarId.eqOfHEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.lean#L65-L71"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.heqOfEq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">heqOfEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Try to apply `heq_of_eq`. If successful, then return new goal, otherwise return `mvarId`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.heqOfEq","kind":"def","line":57,"name":"Lean.MVarId.heqOfEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.lean#L57-L63"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.Meta.reflOrProve\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">reflOrProve</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rfl </span><span class=\"fn\">prove</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Proves a goal with `rfl`, provided that no reduction step needs the constructor of a `String`\nliteral (see `Config.stringLitToCtor`). Otherwise, executes `prove`, and tries `rfl` without this\nrestriction if `prove` fails. `rfl` must throw an exception if it fails.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.Meta.reflOrProve","kind":"def","line":41,"name":"Lean.Meta.reflOrProve","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.lean#L41-L55"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.refl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">refl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">check</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Close given goal using `Eq.refl`.\n\nWith (`check := false`), the elaborator does not check if the goal is actually a definitionaly\nequality.\n\nSee `Lean.MVarId.applyRfl` for the variant that also consults `@[refl]` lemmas, and which\nbacks the `rfl` tactic.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.html#Lean.MVarId.refl","kind":"def","line":16,"name":"Lean.MVarId.refl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Refl.lean#L16-L39"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Reduce","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Apply"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Refl"}